{"duration": 21.444, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A silk weaver chased a mouse through his workshop, claws flashing.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.392}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His neighbors laughed, saying a cat would solve it.", "start": 3.812, "end": 6.117}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The mouse multiplies, gnaws bolts of silk, the loom stops.", "start": 6.537, "end": 9.762}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like a pantry raid when you leave crumbs out.", "start": 10.182, "end": 12.881}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Florence bans cats to protect its valuable silk from rodent damage.", "start": 13.301, "end": 17.147}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, the ban hurt the weavers more than the mice.", "start": 17.567, "end": 20.324}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "silk", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "weaver", "start": 0.545, "end": 0.82, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "chased", "start": 0.87, "end": 1.12, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.145, "end": 1.17, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "mouse", "start": 1.22, "end": 1.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "through", "start": 1.545, "end": 1.67, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 1.695, "end": 1.77, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "workshop,", "start": 1.82, "end": 2.52, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "claws", "start": 2.57, "end": 2.845, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "flashing.", "start": 2.895, "end": 3.429, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "His", "start": 3.878, "end": 4.028, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "neighbors", "start": 4.078, "end": 4.403, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "laughed,", "start": 4.453, "end": 4.978, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "saying", "start": 5.028, "end": 5.278, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "a", "start": 5.303, "end": 5.328, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "cat", "start": 5.378, "end": 5.578, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "would", "start": 5.603, "end": 5.703, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "solve", "star